#: cmakemanager.cpp:692
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Configured project '%1' with outdated CMake data. As a result, KDevelop's "
"code understanding may be wrong.\n"
"\n"
"To fix this issue, please right-click the project item in the projects tool "
"view and click 'Reload'."
msgstr ""
"Projekt „%1” konfiguriran je zastarjelim podacima CMake-a. Zbog toga "
"KDevelop možda neće ispravno razumjeti kôd.\n"
"\n"
"Da biste to ispravili, desnom tipkom miša kliknite stavku projekta u prikazu "
"alata Projekti pa kliknite „Ponovno učitaj”."

#: cmakemanager.cpp:703
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Failed to configure project '%1' (error message: %2). As a result, "
"KDevelop's code understanding will likely be broken.\n"
"\n"
"To fix this issue, please ensure that the project's CMakeLists.txt files are "
"correct, and KDevelop is configured to use the correct CMake version and "
"settings. Then right-click the project item in the projects tool view and "
"click 'Reload'."
msgstr ""
"Konfiguriranje projekta „%1” nije uspjelo (poruka pogreške: %2). Zbog toga "
"KDevelop vjerojatno neće ispravno razumjeti kôd.\n"
"\n"
"Da biste to ispravili, provjerite jesu li datoteke CMakeLists.txt projekta "
"ispravne i je li KDevelop konfiguriran za upotrebu ispravne verzije i "
"postavki CMake-a. Zatim desnom tipkom miša kliknite stavku projekta u "
"prikazu alata Projekti pa kliknite „Ponovno učitaj”."

